  "goodToKnow": "Die Genealogie is genealogy, also called Ahnenforschung or Familienforschung, a popular hobby using Kirchenbücher (parish registers), archives and DNA tests. The result is a Stammbaum (family tree). In the Nazi era, genealogy was misused: people needed an Ahnenpass to prove Aryan descent. Der Genealoge is a genealogist. Plural: die Genealogien."
